<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
    <!-- 危险警告遮罩 -->
<div id="dangerOverlay" class="danger-overlay hidden" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="danger-text">未撰写该线索</div>
</div>

<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>键入死亡</title>
<style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Ma+Shan+Zheng&display=swap'); /* 引入马善政毛笔字体 */
    body {
        background: #060606;
        color: #fff;
        font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
        height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    }

    .screen {
        width: 820px;
        height: 900px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        padding: 18px 20px;
        border: 2px solid #5a4a30;
        background: #0a0a0a;
        box-shadow:
            inset 0 0 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5),
            inset 0 0 120px rgba(80,50,20,0.08),
            0 0 0 1px rgba(140,110,60,0.3),
            0 0 0 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.4),
            0 0 0 5px rgba(100,75,35,0.25),
            2px 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.6),
            0 0 2px rgba(180,140,80,0.15);
        outline: 1px solid rgba(80,55,25,0.5);
        outline-offset: -8px;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
        position: relative;
        overflow-y: auto;
        scrollbar-width: thin;
        scrollbar-color: #444 #000;
    }

    .screen::-webkit-scrollbar {
        width: 8px;
    }
    .screen::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
        background: #000;
        border-left: 1px solid #333;
    }
    .screen::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
        background: #666;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .screen::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
        background: #888;
    }

.screen::before {// 背景文字
        content: "键入死亡";
        position: fixed;
        top: 50%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        font-size: 120px;
       font-family: "Ma Shan Zheng", "KaiTi", "STKaiti", cursive;
        color: rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.08);
        font-weight: normal;
        letter-spacing: 20px; /* 调整字间距，数值越大字越散，可根据视觉效果自行调整 */
        white-space: nowrap;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
        user-select: none;
    }

    .screen > * {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
    }

    .input-line {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
        gap: 12px;
    }

    input {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        border: 1px solid #666;
        border-radius: 2px;
        color: #fff;
        font-family: inherit;
        font-size: inherit;
        letter-spacing: 0.6px;
        outline: none;
        padding: 6px 8px;
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
        width: 240px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    input:focus {
        border-color: #fff;
        box-shadow: 
            inset 0 0 6px rgba(255,255,255,0.1),
            0 0 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }

    .page-name {
        color: #ff69b4;
        font-size: 0.9em;
        white-space: nowrap;
        opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .return-btn {
        color: #ff69b4;
        font-size: 0.9em;
        white-space: nowrap;
        cursor: pointer;
        opacity: 0.9;
        transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }

    .return-btn:hover {
        opacity: 1;
        text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .hidden {
        display: none;
    }

    .code {
        cursor: pointer;
        text-decoration: underline;
        color: #888;
        margin-top: 10px;
        margin-right: 20px;
        display: inline-block;
        transition: opacity 0.3s ease, visibility 0.3s ease;
    }

    .code:hover {
        color: #fff;
    }

    .code.hidden {
        opacity: 0;
        visibility: hidden;
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    .unlock-message {
        color: #ffffff;
        margin-bottom: 2px;
        font-size: 1.5em;
        opacity: 0;
        visibility: hidden;
        display: block;
        transition: opacity 0.35s ease, visibility 0.35s ease;
    }

    #infoScreen .input-line {
        margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .unlock-message.visible {
        opacity: 1;
        visibility: visible;
    }

    .unlock-message.hidden {
        display: block;
        opacity: 0;
        visibility: hidden;
    }

    .codes-container {
        margin-top: 1px;
    }

    .pixel-book {
        position: absolute;
        top: 100px;
        right: 200px;
        width: 100px;
        height: 155px;
        z-index: 100;
        perspective: 1200px;
        transform: rotate(-3deg);
    }

    .book-cover {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5D3A1A 0%, #3E2210 40%, #2D1A0A 100%);
        border: 3px solid #4A2A10;
        border-radius: 3px 6px 6px 3px;
        box-shadow:
            inset 0 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5),
            3px 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.6),
            5px 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .book-cover::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 6px;
        left: 6px;
        right: 6px;
        bottom: 6px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(180,140,80,0.4);
        border-radius: 1px 4px 4px 1px;
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    .book-cover::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 14px;
        left: 10px;
        right: 10px;
        bottom: 14px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(180,140,80,0.25);
        border-radius: 1px 3px 3px 1px;
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    .book-spine {
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        top: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        width: 16px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2D1A0A 0%, #4A2810 50%, #3E2210 100%);
        border-right: 2px solid rgba(180,140,80,0.3);
        border-radius: 3px 0 0 3px;
        z-index: 2;
    }

    .book-spine::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 12px;
        left: 3px;
        right: 3px;
        bottom: 12px;
        background: repeating-linear-gradient(
            to bottom,
            rgba(180,140,80,0.2) 0px,
            rgba(180,140,80,0.2) 1px,
            transparent 1px,
            transparent 8px
        );
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    .book-corner {
        position: absolute;
        width: 12px;
        height: 12px;
        border: 2px solid rgba(180,140,80,0.5);
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 3;
    }

    .book-corner.top-left {
        top: 5px;
        left: 5px;
        border-right: none;
        border-bottom: none;
        border-radius: 2px 0 0 0;
    }

    .book-corner.top-right {
        top: 5px;
        right: 5px;
        border-left: none;
        border-bottom: none;
        border-radius: 0 2px 0 0;
    }

    .book-corner.bottom-left {
        bottom: 5px;
        left: 5px;
        border-right: none;
        border-top: none;
        border-radius: 0 0 0 2px;
    }

    .book-corner.bottom-right {
        bottom: 5px;
        right: 5px;
        border-left: none;
        border-top: none;
        border-radius: 0 0 2px 0;
    }

    .book-pages {
        position: absolute;
        top: 8px;
        left: 18px;
        right: 6px;
        bottom: 8px;
        transform-style: preserve-3d;
    }

    .page {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background:
            repeating-linear-gradient(
                to bottom,
                transparent,
                transparent 6px,
                rgba(160,140,100,0.35) 6px,
                rgba(160,140,100,0.35) 7px
            ),
            linear-gradient(to bottom, #F5EDE0 0%, #EDE0CC 100%);
        border: 1px solid #c8b898;
        border-left: 2px solid #d4c4a4;
        border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0;
        box-shadow:
            inset 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.04),
            0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        transform-origin: right center;
        opacity: 1;
        backface-visibility: hidden;
        transform-style: preserve-3d;
        will-change: transform;
    }

    .page::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 0%, transparent 8%, transparent 92%, rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 100%);
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    .page::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 5px;
        background:
            repeating-linear-gradient(
                to bottom,
                rgba(180,160,120,0.1),
                rgba(180,160,120,0.1) 1px,
                transparent 1px,
                transparent 7px
            );
        border-radius: 0 1px 1px 0;
        transform: rotateY(180deg);
        backface-visibility: hidden;
    }

    .page-1, .page-2, .page-3, .page-4 {
        animation: none;
    }

    .page-1 { z-index: 4; }
    .page-2 { z-index: 3; }
    .page-3 { z-index: 2; }
    .page-4 { z-index: 1; }

    .pixel-book.book-open .page-1 {
        animation: flip-page-open 1.0s ease-in-out 0s 1 forwards;
    }

    .pixel-book.book-open .page-2 {
        animation: flip-page-open 1.0s ease-in-out 0.1s 1 forwards;
    }

    .pixel-book.book-open .page-3 {
        animation: flip-page-open 1.0s ease-in-out 0.2s 1 forwards;
    }

    .pixel-book.book-open .page-4 {
        animation: flip-page-open 1.0s ease-in-out 0.3s 1 forwards;
    }

    @keyframes flip-page-open {
        0% {
            transform: rotateY(0deg);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.04), 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }
        40% {
            transform: rotateY(28deg);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.04), -2px 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
        }
        75% {
            transform: rotateY(18deg);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.04), -2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        100% {
            transform: rotateY(20deg);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.04), -1px 0px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }
    }

    .marker {
        color: #a064dd;
        cursor: pointer;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
        padding: 0 4px;
        margin-right: 8px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        display: inline-block;
        min-width: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        outline: none;
        user-select: none;
    }

    .marker:hover {
        border-color: #555;
    }

    .marker:focus {
        border-color: #b366ff;
        background: rgba(179, 102, 255, 0.1);
    }

    .content {
        flex: 1;
        word-break: break-word;
    }

    .third-line, .fourth-line, .fifth-line {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .third-text, .fourth-text, .fifth-text {
        margin-top: 10px;
        display: block;
    }

    .reset-btn {
        color: #ff4444;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 0.9em;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        display: inline-block;
        text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .reset-btn:hover {
        color: #ff6666;
    }

/* 重置对话框样式 */
    .modal {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); /* 修改为半透明黑色背景，避免全屏红色 */
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        z-index: 1500;
        opacity: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        transition: opacity 520ms cubic-bezier(.2, .05, .1, 1);
    }

    .modal.show {
        opacity: 1;
        visibility: visible;
        pointer-events: auto;
        transition: opacity 520ms cubic-bezier(.2, .05, .1, 1), visibility 0s linear 0s;
    }

    /* 危险警告遮罩 */
    .danger-overlay {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        z-index: 2000;
        background: rgba(80, 10, 10, 0.92);
        opacity: 0;
        visibility: hidden;
        pointer-events: none;
        transition: opacity 0.2s ease, visibility 0s linear 0.2s;
    }

    .danger-overlay.show {
        opacity: 1;
        visibility: visible;
        pointer-events: auto;
        transition: opacity 0.2s ease, visibility 0s linear 0s;
    }



.danger-text {
    color: #ff3333;
    font-size: 60px;
    font-family: "Ma Shan Zheng", "KaiTi", cursive;
    letter-spacing: 8px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 40px rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.4);
    animation: danger-pulse 0.4s ease-in-out infinite alternate, danger-shake 0.1s linear infinite;
    z-index: 2002;          /* 比对角线的2001更高，确保文字在上层 */
    position: relative;      /* 确保z-index生效 */
}


        @keyframes danger-pulse {
            0% { opacity: 0.6; transform: scale(1); }
            100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.05); }
        }

        @keyframes danger-shake {
            0% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
            15% { transform: translate(-4px, 1px); }
            30% { transform: translate(3px, -1px); }
            45% { transform: translate(-2px, 2px); }
            60% { transform: translate(4px, 0); }
            75% { transform: translate(-3px, -1px); }
            90% { transform: translate(1px, 1px); }
            100% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
        }



    .modal-box {/* 回到原点确认对话框样式 */
        background: #060606;
        border: 1.5px solid #fff;
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 18px 20px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06), inset 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,.03);
    }

    /* 对话框恐怖振动效果 */
    .modal-box.shaking {
        animation: horror-shake 0.15s ease-in-out infinite, horror-flicker 0.1s steps(2) infinite;
        box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 68, 68, 0.6), 0 0 40px rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.3), inset 0 0 20px rgba(255, 68, 68, 0.1);
        border-color: #ff4444;
    }

    @keyframes horror-shake {
        0% { transform: translateX(-8px); }
        25% { transform: translateX(8px); }
        50% { transform: translateX(-6px); }
        75% { transform: translateX(6px); }
        100% { transform: translateX(-8px); }
    }

    @keyframes horror-flicker {
        0% { opacity: 1; }
        50% { opacity: 0.7; }
        100% { opacity: 1; }
    }

    .modal-title {
        color: #ff4444;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .modal-body {
        color: #ddd;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .modal-actions {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        gap: 8px;
    }

    .btn {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
        border: 1px solid #666;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 6px 10px;
        border-radius: 3px;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-family: inherit;
    }

    .btn.confirm {
        border-color: #ff4444;
        color: #ff4444;
    }

    .btn.cancel:hover, .btn.confirm:hover {
        filter: brightness(1.08);
    }

    <style>
        /* 纸张烧焦遮罩动画：放缓移动速度，模拟火焰逐渐吞噬 */
        @keyframes burn-paper {
            0% {
                -webkit-mask-position: 0 0;
                mask-position: 0 0;
    }

                -webkit-mask-position: -120% 0;
                mask-position: -120% 0;
            }
        }

/* 底部逐行淡出动画（按从下往上顺序延迟） */
        @keyframes burn-away-bottom {
            0% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
            100% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
        }

        /* 覆盖层：从底部向上增长，覆盖内容与边框，配合逐行淡出产生自下而上的吞噬效果 */
        @keyframes burn-cover {
            0% { height: 0%; }
            100% { height: 100%; }
        }

        /* 组合应用燃烧效果的类 */
        .burning {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            pointer-events: none; /* 燃烧期间防止重复点击 */
        }

        /* 子元素逐行淡出，总时长 1.5s，按从下往上延迟 */
        .burning > * {
            animation: burn-away-bottom 1.5s ease-in forwards;
            transform-origin: bottom;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .burning > *:nth-last-child(1) { animation-delay: 0s; }
        .burning > *:nth-last-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
        .burning > *:nth-last-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
        .burning > *:nth-last-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
        .burning > *:nth-last-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
        .burning > *:nth-last-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
        .burning > *:nth-last-child(7) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }
        .burning > *:nth-last-child(8) { animation-delay: 0.7s; }
        .burning > *:nth-last-child(9) { animation-delay: 0.8s; }
        .burning > *:nth-last-child(10) { animation-delay: 0.9s; }
        .burning > *:nth-last-child(11) { animation-delay: 1.0s; }
        .burning > *:nth-last-child(12) { animation-delay: 1.1s; }

        /* 覆盖层用于遮盖边框与未被子元素覆盖的区域 */
        .burning::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            height: 0%;
            background: #000; /* 页面背景色 */
            z-index: 2;
            pointer-events: none;
            animation: burn-cover 3s linear forwards;
        }

        .modal.fade-out-overlay {
            animation: fadeOut 4s ease-in forwards;
        }

        @keyframes fadeOut {
            to { opacity: 0; }
        }

        /* 开场页面样式 */
        .intro-screen {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background: #000;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            z-index: 3000;
            font-family: "Ma Shan Zheng", "KaiTi", "STKaiti", cursive;
            transition: opacity 1s ease-out, visibility 1s ease-out;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .intro-screen.fade-out {
            opacity: 0;
            visibility: hidden;
        }

        .intro-content {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 30px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .intro-text {
            font-size: 80px;
            color: #fff;
            letter-spacing: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .intro-subtitle {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #888;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .intro-subchar {
            opacity: 0;
            filter: blur(2px);
            min-width: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .intro-subchar.show {
            animation: typeCharSubtitle 0.5s ease-out forwards;
        }

        @keyframes typeCharSubtitle {
            0% {
                opacity: 0;
                filter: blur(2px);
            }
            100% {
                opacity: 1;
                filter: blur(0);
            }
        }

        .intro-hint {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            opacity: 0.7;
            animation: hintBlink 2s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes hintBlink {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.7; }
            50% { opacity: 0.3; }
        }

        .intro-char {
            opacity: 0;
            filter: blur(2px);
            min-width: 80px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .intro-char.show {
            animation: typeCharSubtitle 0.5s ease-out forwards;
        }

        @keyframes typeChar {
            0% {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(20px);
                filter: blur(2px);
            }
            100% {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
                filter: blur(0);
            }
        }

        .intro-cursor {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 4px;
            height: 80px;
            background: #fff;
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
            animation: cursorBlink 0.6s infinite;
            transition: left 0.1s ease-out, top 0.1s ease-out, height 0.1s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes cursorBlink {
            0%, 50% { opacity: 1; }
            51%, 100% { opacity: 0; }
        }

        .intro-screen.hidden {
            display: none;
        }

        /* 粒子消散画布覆盖层 */
        .dissolve-canvas {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: 3001;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* 开场剧情页面样式 */
        .story-content {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .story-content p {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-indent: 2em;
        }

        .story-content .unknown-letter {
            font-style: italic;
            color: #ff69b4;
        }

        /* 打字机效果：从左至右依次弹出 */
        .story-char {
            opacity: 0;
            animation: typewriteIn 0.01s linear forwards;
        }

        @keyframes typewriteIn {
            0% { opacity: 0; }
            100% { opacity: 1; }
        }

        /* 游戏开始页面淡入效果 */
        .screen {
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease-in;
        }

        .screen.visible {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        /* 短信气泡样式 */
        .sms-phone {
            background: #f5f5f5;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 16px 14px 20px 14px;
            margin: 10px auto;
            max-width: 480px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #e0e0e0, 0 0 0 5px #f5f5f5, 0 0 0 6px #d0d0d0, 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .sms-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .sms-header {
            text-align: center;
            color: #555;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }

        .sms-contact {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 6px 0 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .sms-avatar {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #4a90d9;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #fff;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .sms-sender-name {
            color: #222;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .sms-sender-sub {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 11px;
        }

        .sms-bubble {
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 4px 14px 14px 14px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            max-width: 88%;
            align-self: flex-start;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .sms-bubble .sms-title {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            padding-bottom: 6px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .sms-bubble .sms-text {
            color: #444;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .sms-bubble .sms-number {
            color: #444;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin: 4px 0;
            padding-left: 12px;
            border-left: 2px solid rgba(100,160,100,0.2);
        }

        .sms-bubble .sms-hint {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-style: italic;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-top: 6px;
            padding-top: 6px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .sms-time {
            color: #bbb;
            font-size: 11px;
            text-align: right;
            margin-top: 1px;
            align-self: flex-start;
            max-width: 88%;
        }

        /* 右下角消息提示 */
        .toast-notification {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 24px;
            right: 24px;
            background: rgba(10, 0, 15, 0.96);
            border: 1.5px solid rgba(180, 120, 60, 0.7);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 16px 28px;
            color: #d4a860;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 0 12px rgba(180,120,60,0.2);
            z-index: 9999;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(16px);
            transition: opacity 0.35s ease, transform 0.35s ease;
            pointer-events: auto;
            cursor: pointer;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .toast-notification::before {
            content: '\01F4E8';
            margin-right: 10px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .toast-notification.show {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .toast-notification.show:hover {
            background: rgba(20, 5, 25, 0.96);
            border-color: rgba(200, 150, 70, 1);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), 0 0 20px rgba(200,150,70,0.4);
        }
    </style>


<!-- 模态对话框 -->
<div id="modal" class="modal hidden" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-box">
        <div class="modal-title">标题</div>
        <div class="modal-body">内容</div>
        <div class="modal-actions">
            <button id="modalConfirm" class="btn confirm">确认</button>
            <button id="modalCancel" class="btn cancel">取消</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- 烧焦效果遮罩 -->
</head>
<body>

<!-- SVG 定义：用于生成带不规则边缘的遮罩图 -->
<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute">
    <defs>
        <filter id="burn-edge">
            <feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.04" numOctaves="5" seed="2" result="noise" />
            <feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" in2="noise" scale="20" xChannelSelector="R" yChannelSelector="G" />
        </filter>
    </defs>
</svg>

<!-- 右下角弹出消息提示 -->
<div id="toastNotification" class="toast-notification"></div>

<!-- 开场页面 -->
<div class="intro-screen" id="introScreen">
    <div class="intro-content">
        <span class="intro-cursor"></span>
        <div class="intro-text">
            <span class="intro-char" data-index="0">键</span>
            <span class="intro-char" data-index="1">入</span>
            <span class="intro-char" data-index="2">死</span>
            <span class="intro-char" data-index="3">亡</span>
        </div>
        <div class="intro-subtitle">
            <span class="intro-subchar" data-index="0">b</span>
            <span class="intro-subchar" data-index="1">y</span>
            <span class="intro-subchar" data-index="2"> </span>
            <span class="intro-subchar" data-index="3">红</span>
            <span class="intro-subchar" data-index="4">瞳</span>
            <span class="intro-subchar" data-index="5">朱</span>
            <span class="intro-subchar" data-index="6">雀</span>
        </div>
        <div class="intro-hint" id="introHint">点击屏幕开始</div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- 开场剧情页面 -->
<div class="screen hidden" id="storyScreen">
    <div class="input-line">
        <span>&gt; </span>
        <input id="storyInput" placeholder="输入线索...">
    </div>
    <div class="story-content">
        <p>作为大学音乐社团的一份子，前几天听说社长再过几天将要准备策划一场团建。你当然乐见其成，毕竟能和志同道合的人一起玩音乐是一件幸事。</p>
        <p>果不其然，今天在寝室午觉醒来后看到手机上就收到了社长发来的短信（<span class="unknown-letter">未知的来信</span>）。不过奇怪的是，虽然短信抬头是社长周明朗的名字，发信人却是社团里另一位成员陈逸舟。</p>
        <p>"他好像以前就和社长认识，活动是他和社长一起组织的吗"。并未多想，到了当天你仍旧准备好了一切，踏上了这趟准备了很久的音乐之行。</p>
    </div>
</div>

