<!-- 第三页 -->
<div class="screen hidden" id="thirdScreen">
    <div class="input-line">
        <span>&gt; </span>
        <input id="thirdInput" placeholder="输入线索...">
        <span class="page-name">1-BU-01-02-03-05-06-07-08-09</span>
        <span class="return-btn" onclick="showScreen('info'); checkUnlocks();">| 返回</span>
    </div>

    <div class="unlock-message hidden">*已寻找到新线索*</div>

    <div class="third-text">
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">2023年夏天，晴，01，02，03，05，06，07，08，09在面包车（Bus）内。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker5">05</span>
            <span class="content">我们今天要去的地方怎么还不说啊!社长也不知道什么时候才到，再坐车下去我都要快吐了。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">快了，快了。大家体谅一下，明朗好不容易找到这么一个风景又好又便宜的民宿，等到了地方大家随便休息，现在再忍忍。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">01的表情似乎很不舒服。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker2">02</span>
            <span class="content">佳宁，我把窗户打开你透一下气。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker9">09</span>
            <span class="content">我来帮你拉吧，这些车的窗户拉起来还挺费劲的。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker7">07</span>
            <span class="content">闲着也是闲着，我们唱会歌吧，刚好我买了一块很贵的松香，还没用过。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker9">09</span>
            <span class="content">你们唱吧，我也有一点晕车不舒服。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker3">03</span>
            <span class="content">来呗，大家一起跟着唱歌。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">03拉着06说。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker7">07</span>
            <span class="content">有人晕车我们这么唱太吵了不太好吧。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker8">08</span>
            <span class="content">没事没事，我们小声一点。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">再过二十分钟就到民宿入口（Entrznce）了。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">面包车（Bus）继续朝着山里驶去。</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- 第四页（1-ZHOU-04-12） -->
<div class="screen hidden" id="fourthScreen">
    <div class="input-line">
        <span>&gt; </span>
        <input id="fourthInput" placeholder="输入线索...">
        <span class="page-name">1-ZHOU-04-12</span> <!-- ✅ 修改为1-ZHOU-04-12 -->
        <span class="return-btn" onclick="showScreen('info'); checkUnlocks();">| 返回</span>
    </div>

    <div class="unlock-message hidden">*已寻找到新线索*</div>

    <div class="fourth-text">
        <div class="fourth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker4">04</span>
            <span class="content">04似乎在打电话。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fourth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker4">04</span>
            <span class="content">我说过了，你必须为你的行为付出代价!你要是不帮我那就等着和那些一样的下场吧!</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fourth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">电话那头传来哭泣的声音，对方说话语无伦次。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fourth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker4">04</span>
            <span class="content">唉，就这一次，成功之后我会把一切都揽在我身上，和你就没有什么关系了。你要做的就是按照我们之前的计划把他们组织好带到这里就可以了，至于他们会怎么死去你就不管。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fourth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">门外传来扫把倒下的声音。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fourth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker4">04</span>
            <span class="content">他妈的，谁在那!这个时候怎么还会有人。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fourth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker12">12</span>
            <span class="content">我......我只是来打扫卫生的,什么都没听见啊。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fourth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">12颤抖着向楼下大门跑去。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fourth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker4">04</span>
            <span class="content">停下来!那里有.....</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fourth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">12摔下楼梯。</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<!-- 第五页 -->
<div class="screen hidden" id="fifthScreen">
    <div class="input-line">
        <span>&gt; </span>
        <input id="fifthInput" placeholder="输入线索...">
        <span class="page-name">2-EN-01-02-03-05-06-07-08-09</span>
        <span class="return-btn" onclick="showScreen('info'); checkUnlocks();">| 返回</span>
    </div>

    <div class="unlock-message hidden">*已寻找到新线索*</div>
    <div class="fifth-text">
        <div class="fifth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">面包车停在了民宿入口（Entrance）</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fifth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">咳咳......大家赶路辛苦了，房间在之前已经给大家分配好了，一共有两层，门上有门牌号，我们先进去放东西，要休息的也可以这会休息。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fifth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker3">03</span>
            <span class="content">欣欣，我们先去房间（Shen）放东西吧。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fifth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker7">07</span>
            <span class="content">有男朋友就是好，还能有人帮着忙提东西。喂，能不能帮我拿上去。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fifth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">07手指向06，06似乎没反应</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fifth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">你们其他人呢？我去客厅休息会，其他人先去房间放东西还是现在去逛一逛。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fifth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker6">06</span>
            <span class="content">我们两个不急，先去客厅（Living room）休息一会。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fifth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker9">09</span>
            <span class="content">那我们两个先去房间（SU）收拾，许佳宁刚刚晕车太严重了，估计要躺一会才缓得过来。你们照看一下</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fifth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">那就先这样吧，大家休息一会。按照之前的安排刘思琪和林宇两个去厨房做饭，其他人有空地来帮忙。解散。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fifth-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">02、03、07、08、09离开了</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

