        <span class="return-btn" onclick="showScreen('info'); checkUnlocks();">| 返回</span>
    </div>

    <div class="unlock-message hidden">*已寻找到新线索*</div>

    <div class="third-text">
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker6">06</span>
            <span class="content">话说你们也是收到社长短信才来的吗，为什么发信人是你？</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">第二条短信说了，他比较忙要晚一会才来，所以一些工作就交由我来做了。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker5">05</span>
            <span class="content">要不是苏雨桐硬来着我陪她，谁会跑这么远来玩啊，学校又不是没有社团场地。话说她人呢？</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">和男朋友去房间放行李了。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker5">05</span>
            <span class="content">唔......晕车还没缓过来，我先在这躺一会，有事再叫我。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">等一会刘思琪和林宇就要去厨房（Kitchen）做饭了，我们坐一会也去帮忙吧。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker6">06</span>
            <span class="content">嗯，等会你先去，我去叫我哥沈泽近（Shen）和赵欣怡帮忙。</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- 第九页：3-SHEN-03-08 -->
<div class="screen hidden" id="ninthScreen">
    <div class="input-line">
