            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker3">03</span>
            <span class="content">你有没有感觉很怪。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker8">08</span>
            <span class="content">嗯？什么方面。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker3">03</span>
            <span class="content">这个地方也太偏了吧，周围就我们一户人家，总感觉毛骨悚然的。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker8">08</span>
            <span class="content">或许周明朗就喜欢这种环境？</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker8">08</span>
            <span class="content">不做亏心事不怕鬼敲门。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker3">03</span>
            <span class="content">我们真的敢说没做吗？</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker8">08</span>
            <span class="content">先休息一会吧，这次出来就好好玩，其他的事情再说吧。</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- 第十页：3-SU-02-09 -->
<div class="screen hidden" id="tenthScreen">
