            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker2">02</span>
            <span class="content">床好大好舒服啊，能不能别老看手机，你也快来躺着。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker9">09</span>
            <span class="content">不了，东西放下后我要出去一下。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker2">02</span>
            <span class="content">难得的独处时间你还要出去吗，能不能不走？</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker9">09</span>
            <span class="content">亲爱的，我只是有点饿了。离吃饭还有一会时间，我去找一找有没有吃的填一下肚子，很快就回来。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker2">02</span>
            <span class="content">烦人。好吧，记得早点回来给我带一点吃的。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
