    <div class="unlock-message hidden">*已寻找到新线索*</div>

    <div class="third-text">
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">厨房门被推开</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker7">07</span>
            <span class="content">是来厨房帮忙的吗，我觉得你好像很眼熟，我们是不是以前见过？</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker9">09</span>
            <span class="content">哈哈，这种搭讪技巧过于老套了。除了几个情侣之外，其他所有人应该都没见过面才对，大家都是才进入社团的人。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker7">07</span>
            <span class="content">可是我真的觉得你很眼熟，你是不是还有个妹妹。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker9">09</span>
            <span class="content">苏雨桐都知道的，我是独子，没有什么妹妹。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker7">07</span>
            <span class="content">谁是苏雨桐，车上坐你旁边那个女生吗？</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">厨房门被打开了，07和09对话结束。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">你们两个已经在这里了啊，需要我帮什么忙吗？</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker9">9</span>
            <span class="content">你自己看着来吧，怎么只有你过来了。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">许佳宁一直在客厅躺着，沈泽远去叫他哥和赵欣怡（Shen）一起来厨房帮忙了，过一会应该也过来了吧。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker9">09</span>
            <span class="content">过一会我就先离开了，雨桐还在等我给她带一些吃的。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">09离开了</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- 第十二页：5-KI-01-03-06-07-08-09 -->
<div class="screen hidden" id="twelfthScreen">
    <div class="input-line">
        <span>&gt; </span>
        <input id="twelfthInput" placeholder="输入线索...">
        <span class="page-name">5-KI-01-03-06-07-08-09</span>
        <span class="return-btn" onclick="showScreen('info'); checkUnlocks();">| 返回</span>
    </div>

    <div class="unlock-message hidden">*已寻找到新线索*</div>
    
    <div class="third-text">
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">03、06、08来到厨房</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker7">07</span>
            <span class="content">来的正好，快来帮忙把菜切了，我们快要忙不过来了。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker8">08</span>
            <span class="content">自我介绍一下，我叫赵欣怡，我来帮你。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker6">06</span>
            <span class="content">我叫沈泽远，这是我哥。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker3">03</span>
            <span class="content">你是组织者陈逸舟是吧，我们到这个民宿也有这么久了，为什么社长到现在还是一点消息都没有，会不会出什么事了？</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">说实话，自从来到这里后我也没收到过他的消息了，再等等。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker3">03</span>
            <span class="content">我看二楼走廊最里面还剩一个房间（Zhou），是不是留给社长的？</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">是的。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker7">07</span>
            <span class="content">那我和她去看看房间里有没有人吧，说不定人早就来了在里面躺着休息。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker9">09</span>
            <span class="content">等饭菜上好了再去吧，如果他在的话直接叫他下来吃饭。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker3">03</span>
            <span class="content">也行，这里厨房也快忙完了，等会就都在餐厅（Dining room）集合吧。我去叫所有人下来。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">07、08离开了</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- 第十三页：6-DI-01-02-03-05-06-09 -->
<div class="screen hidden" id="thirteenthScreen">
    <div class="input-line">
        <span>&gt; </span>
        <input id="thirteenthInput" placeholder="输入线索...">
        <span class="page-name">6-DI-01-02-03-05-06-09</span>
        <span class="return-btn" onclick="showScreen('info'); checkUnlocks();">| 返回</span>
    </div>

    <div class="unlock-message hidden">*已寻找到新线索*</div>
    
    <div class="third-text">
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">除了另外两个去二楼了，其他人应该都到齐了。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker2">02</span>
            <span class="content">刚刚林宇给我带的都不够吃，还好有这么一顿大餐。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">大家都挺自来熟的，那就好了，大家都有共同的爱好气氛不会太僵硬。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">桌子发出剧烈的撞击声</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker3">03</span>
            <span class="content">大家真的没觉得不对劲吗！我想问问大家都是怎么来的，我后悔了，现在我就要马上离开。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">楼上发出咚咚的声音</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker5">05</span>
            <span class="content">不是社长发的消息请我们来的吗？</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker3">03</span>
            <span class="content">是也不是，虽然消息的抬头是周明朗，但是发信人是陈逸舟。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker9">09</span>
            <span class="content">没错，社长自始至终都没有露过面，要不是大家一个学校我都要怀疑是什么诈骗消息了。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker6">06</span>
            <span class="content">我完全是因为我哥来了这里我才来的，一个人在学校待着没意思。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">来都来了，你要走总要给个理由吧，大家都在这里你一个人离开就太扫兴了。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">03离开椅子被01拉住</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker3">03</span>
            <span class="content">我错了，我真的错了。我还不想死啊。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker6">06</span>
            <span class="content">哥，冷静一点！至少也等到你女朋友下来一起走吧。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker3">03</span>
            <span class="content">对，对，对。还有欣怡，她现在在哪？我要去找她。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">楼上房间发出尖叫</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker9">09</span>
            <span class="content">发生什么事了，还有两个人在楼上。先别管这的事了，上去看一下。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">所有人离开了。</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- 第十四页：7-ZHOU-01-02-03-05-06-07-08-09 -->
<div class="screen hidden" id="fourteenthScreen">
    <div class="input-line">
        <span>&gt; </span>
        <input id="fourteenthInput" placeholder="输入线索...">
        <span class="page-name">7-ZHOU-01-02-03-05-06-07-08-09</span>
        <span class="return-btn" onclick="showScreen('info'); checkUnlocks();">| 返回</span>
    </div>

    <div class="unlock-message hidden">*已寻找到新线索*</div>
    
    <div class="third-text">
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">01、02、03、05、06、09来到周明朗（Zhou）房间</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker3">03</span>
            <span class="content">发生什么了，思琪你没事吧。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker7">07</span>
            <span class="content">你们都来了，我们刚来这里的时候敲门没反应就想着直接进去看一看，结果发现了这些。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker8">08</span>
            <span class="content">地上......地上有具无头尸体。这是社长的房间吧，不知道是不是社长。唔，不行了，我要吐了。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">房间里混合着灰尘和血腥味，尸体的头颅不见了，整具躯体呈现出不自然的歪曲。右腿的胫骨刺穿了裤子露在外面。颈部的断面像一口参差不齐的黑尽吞噬着众人的恐惧，皮肉外翻，仅剩的骨头像折断的树枝一样突兀地刺出来。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">让我看看。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker9">09</span>
            <span class="content">对了，你是唯一见过社长的人，你来看看这具尸体是——</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">01似乎想到了什么惊呼一声打断了众人的讲话声和思绪。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">是他，真的是他。虽然头不见了，但是体型和衣服都和我几天前看到的社长一模一样。怎么会这样。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker2">02</span>
            <span class="content">我看着也有点不舒服。他是社长的话那现在怎么办，我们这些人现在总的跑吧，说不定杀人犯还在这附近。你不是组织者吗，你快想办法啊！</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker13">@</span>
            <span class="content">01仍在惊吓中没有听到02的提醒。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker5">05</span>
            <span class="content">大家冷静一下，我刚刚看了手机并没有信号，但是在我们吃饭之前却是正常的。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker6">06</span>
            <span class="content">周围有没有交通工具之类的可以载几个人去找最近的人家报警。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker9">09</span>
            <span class="content">不可能的，我们来的时候大家应该都发现了这周围没有什么人，最近的估计也要有个十几二十公里才能找到。而来接我们回去的面包车也要两天后才会来。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker1">01</span>
            <span class="content">我不能再看下去了，我先下楼缓一缓，你们接着讨论吧。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
            <span class="marker" contenteditable="true" data-key="marker8">08</span>
            <span class="content">我也是，我想先回房间休息，我一个人可以的，沈泽近你就先和他们在一起吧。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="third-line">
